{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c5cb2722-2c05-8ff0-a898-7f7c58b368df",
  "created_at": "2026-02-18T14:01:50-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Hector Figueroa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:59:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:59:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, thank you for taking my call. My name is Hector Figueroa. I am calling about my recycling bin, thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:59:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, Mr. Figueroa. What's going on with the bin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T13:59:50-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It was left at the curb this morning with a tag on it saying it was rejected. The bin was not emptied. Thank you for listening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:00:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the bin didn't get picked up and there's a rejection tag on it. Can I get the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:00:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, of course. It is 320 Washington Street, in the Point. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:00:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "320 Washington Street. Got it. Do you know what the tag said was the reason? Usually there's a box checked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:00:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a box checked that says contaminated, I believe. But I only put in the usual things, the bottles, cans, and cardboard. I rinsed them. Thank you for asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:00:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. So you're saying it was ordinary recycling, rinsed, and it got tagged contaminated anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:00:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is correct, yes. I would like to ask whether a supervisor could call me back about this, please. I would appreciate it very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:00:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, I can put in a request for a supervisor to call you. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:00:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The number is 401-555-0191. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:00:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0191. And is there a better time of day to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:01:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mornings are best, please. In the afternoons my downstairs neighbor plays his radio quite loudly, and it is difficult to hear on the phone. Thank you for understanding."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:01:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, okay, mornings then. I'll note that. So that's Hector Figueroa, 320 Washington Street, recycling bin tagged rejected as contaminated, supervisor to call back at 401-555-0191, mornings."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:01:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is all correct. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:01:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In the meantime, you can leave the bin where it is, and the supervisor can tell you what to do about the next pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:01:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I will leave it. Thank you, and I appreciate your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:01:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Figueroa. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T14:01:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You as well, thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
